Package: glanceboard-ui
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Glanceboard <rodrigo@bruner.app>
Depends: chromium-browser | chromium, systemd
Description: Glanceboard UI is an ambient dashboard for Raspberry Pi, inspired by iPhone StandBy.
 It shows time, weather, calendar, and more, and is configured to run on startup.
